  "body": "## What\n\n`krn adopt` (krn-works/krn@12df9e2) onboards this repository as the KRN pilot (KRN task t-djnrw3t).\n\n- `krn.json`: repository contract, detected from `packages/seo/package.json` (`npm --prefix packages/seo test`).\n- `.github/workflows/krn-ci.yml` (**KRN CI**): calls the shared project CI (install, lint, typecheck, test under mise-pinned Node 26.10.0). The existing `CI` workflow is not touched.\n- `spec/ci-admission.json`: `krn pr ship` waits for `ci / Check` (GitHub Actions) on the exact head.\n- `.claude/settings.json` Stop hook, `.agents/skills/delivery-*`, rules block in `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md` -> `AGENTS.md`, `.krn/` ignored, `tasks/` seed.\n\n## Verified\n\n- Local clone: `npm --prefix packages/seo ci` exit 0, `npm run verify` 1688/1691 tests passing (2 timeouts under host load, 1 serve profile assertion; to be confirmed by CI here).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
